# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER PUBLISH (this repo is public). Enforced by scripts/check_publishable.py.
# Raw downloads of any kind, in any folder
**/raw/
# Spatial Hub downloads (Improvement Service; not open data)
**/spatialhub/
**/spatial_hub/
**/*spatialhub*
**/*spatial_hub*
**/*SpatialHub*
# Parcel-level geometry (RoS INSPIRE, OGL v3) is kept out of the repo for size: site and
# parcel outlines, parcel tiles, plot geometry. Zone-level tables built from parcels (e.g.
# gis/dz_residential_land.csv, gis/dz_detached_plot_bands.csv) are public_zone and tracked.
# Whether a tracked file may be published is decided by its manifest publish_level.
data/**/*site_outline*
data/**/*plot*.gpkg
data/**/*plot*.geojson
data/**/*plot*.parquet
**/*parcel*.geojson
**/*parcel*.gpkg
**/*parcel*.fgb
**/*parcel*.shp
**/*parcel*.pmtiles
**/*parcel*.mbtiles
**/*.pmtiles
**/*.mbtiles
data/**/*residential_land*.gpkg
data/**/*residential_land*.geojson
data/**/*residential_land*.parquet
# Owner-internal outputs: internal/ folders, site-geometry layers (SVDLS/HLS site
# gpkg are publish_level internal; some outlines are RoS INSPIRE), INSPIRE variants
data/**/internal/
data/**/*.gpkg
data/**/*inspire*
# Anything carrying addresses, postcodes or property identifiers
data/**/*address*
data/**/*postcode*
data/**/*uprn*
data/**/*udprn*
*.ingest.json
